De profectione, 892.—XXIV. De defunctis, 893.</P> <P COM="0955">EPISTOLAE, 893. EPIST. I. Isidori Leudefredo episcopo,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI> —II. Isidori Braulioni archidiacono, 898.—III. Isidori
