 <HI REND="ITALIC">Ed est,</HI>  vel  <HI REND="ITALIC">Id est;</HI>  nam  <HI REND="ITALIC">e</HI>  pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">i</HI>  passim occurrit.</P></NOTE>  CAP. I.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Cuneos.</HI>  Multitudines.</P> <P COM="1308">II.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vexilla.</HI>  Victorias.</P> <P COM="1308"><NOTE TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES COM="1308"><COL N="1308D"></COL> <P COM="1308">CAP. III. Obscura sunt verba  <HI REND="ITALIC">De omnibus,</HI>  et aliquid
