vel collegi.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Duntaxat.</HI>  Videlicet, certe.</P> <P COM="1309">VII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Consuleret.</HI>  Requireret, et interrogaret.</P> <P COM="1309"><NOTE TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES COM="1309"><COL N="1309D"></COL> <P COM="1309">VIII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Stips,</HI>  vel  <HI REND="ITALIC">stipes,</HI>  sumi solet pro pecunia quae
pauperibus confertur; sed hoc loco  <HI REND="ITALIC">stipes</HI>  est lignum.
Verba  <HI REND="ITALIC">conscius longius</HI>  non intelliguntur.</P></NOTE>  VIII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Stipes.</HI>  Mendicus, in alio loco lignum.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Conscius.</HI> 
Longius.</P> <P COM="1309">X.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dimicant.</HI>  Pugnant, in alio loco, lucent.</P> <P COM="1309">XI.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Nausea.</HI>  Vomitus.</P> <P COM="1309">XII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Aenigmata.</HI>  Propositio, quaestiones</P> <P COM="1309"><NOTE TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES COM="1309"><COL N="1309D"></COL> <P COM="1309">XIII. In Vulgata,  <HI REND="ITALIC">praecoquae.</HI></P></NOTE>  XIII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Praecoce.</HI>  Nimis mature.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Lustravimus.</HI>  Circuivimus.</P> <P COM="1309">XIV.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vasta.</HI>  Profunda.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Querelas.</HI>  Accusationes, vel
