 <HI REND="ITALIC">vites;</HI>  alii,  <HI REND="ITALIC">uvae</HI>  pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">vaciae.</HI></NOTE>  Trictilia,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ubi pendent vaciae.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM><NOTE TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1375" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1375"></COL> 1573. Graevius,  <HI REND="ITALIC">trepidat, tremiscit, horret.</HI>  Semlerus,
